#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:130
#: 61d8c75b7682422c9a3139519e37d495
msgid ""
"Use fenced code blocks with language. **Do not use unlabeled** `` ``` `` "
"**fences** for ASCII diagrams or directory trees — sphinx-intl turns those "
"into RST `::` and Chinese HTML leaks a bare `::`. Use a colon fence instead:"
msgstr "带语言标记的围栏代码块。**不要用无语言标记的** `` ``` `` **围栏**画 ASCII 图或目录树——sphinx-intl 会把它们变成 RST 的 `::`，中文 HTML 会漏出裸的 `::`。请改用 colon fence："

